/: planning_agent
/: Mission planning and reporting agent. Handles mission structure,
/: triage, requirement assessment, and compilation of results.
/: Operates on plans and structured data — not on operator conversation
/: or drone hardware directly.
/:
/: Context isolation:
/:   Sees only the validated intent, approved plan, or result sets
/:   scoped to its assigned step.
/:   No access to operator conversation history or drone telemetry.
/:
/: Abilities:
/:   - mission reasoning   triage requests, assess mission components
/:   - file I/O            read mission plans, write structured reports
/:   - code execution      run rule-based logic for route planning,
/:                         waypoint filtering, threshold checks
/:
/: Assigned actions across plans:
/:
/:   uav_mission.ncds
/:     <= triage validated intent into required mission components
/:     <= assess whether navigation work is required by the approved plan  /: -> is navigation required?
/:     <= assess whether error check work is required by the approved plan /: -> is error check required?
/:     <= compile results from all completed mission components
/:     <= deliver mission summary to caller
/:
/:   uav_error_check.ncds
/:     <= assess whether criteria discussion is warranted for this mission /: -> is criteria discussion required?
/:     <= compile error check report from all image analyses
/:
/:   uav_navigation.ncds
/:     <= compile flight log from all waypoint records
/:     <= bundle position, sensor reading, and outcome together
/:
/: Shared across: uav_mission.ncds, uav_navigation.ncds, uav_error_check.ncds
